[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]史实 vs 演义[/font][/b]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]三国演义中的三处华佗场景[/font][/b]


[color=#000000]第十五回（嘉靖第十五节）：[/color]

[indent]•  [color=#0066FF][url={"research": "周泰", "cat": "people"}]周泰[/url][/color]守宣城护[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "孙权", "cat": "people"}]孙权[/url][/color]，身中十二枪。郡吏荐华佗，华佗"童颜鹤发，飘然有出世之姿"，用药一月后周泰痊愈[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
[indent]•  [color=#000000]史实核查[/color]：《三国志·周泰传》仅记"身被十二创，良久乃苏"，[color=#000000]未提及华佗[/color]，演义虚构[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]


[color=#000000]第七十五回（嘉靖约第148—149节）：[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "关羽", "cat": "people"}]关羽[/url][/color]刮骨疗毒[/color]

[indent]•  关羽北伐中右臂中乌头毒箭，华佗慕名而来，刮骨疗毒，血流盈盆，关羽与[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "马良", "cat": "people"}]马良[/url][/color]对弈谈笑自若[/indent]
[font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/12.tres] [/font]
